<h1>About</h1>
<p>This web application serves as a playground for testing Rails applications. That includes learning more about controllers, models, and views, and the processes connecting them to build the frontend.</p>

<h2>Topics</h2>
<p>In this playground, I have learned how to do the following in the Ruby on Rails framework.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Generating DB Scaffolds</li>
    <li>Deploying Rails using Render</li>
    <li>Version management using Git</li>
    <li>HTML and embedded Ruby</li>
    <li>SQL Queries and their simplification via Rails and Active Record</li>
</ul>

